+# CLAUDE.md — RUWAQ assistant instructions
+
+For all Riwaq assignments, **first** read `docs/RUWAQ_EDITORIAL_STANDARD.md` and obey its gates G0–G6. It is the single source of truth for editorial decisions, historical verification, interpretation of YouTube analytics, scripting, packaging and release approvals.
+
+For styling or rendering, use `data/brand.json` and `docs/RUNBOOK.md`, not inferred design choices. Review `ASSETS_LICENSE.md` for rights. Never hardcode unverified facts, extrapolate from tiny samples, assume a 20-minute mandatory duration, infer CTR causes from one metric, or claim a result was tested when it was not. Preserve historical nuance and clearly tag AI reconstructions. No publishing or credit spending without owner permission.
+
+For delivery, use the report fields in Section 11 of the editorial standard. If the canonical policy is unavailable, explicitly report the blocker and do not substitute a remembered version.
